{"author":"rebar-bridge[bot]","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1787865428193930463,"compiled_state":{"alias":"waspy-piecemeal-queenconch","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"96b9bcd1aaa7ab719bb35d5e842b6d210cf2edfc67d865c7e69b2d766c80323e","event_uuid":"7aa91833-3233-4cec-ba9d-522a0a8050d9","position":{"commit_sha":"42d0ad595f1b9846c934409223b6e881e8f19c6f","position":"1787861992254001001-7aa91833-3233-4cec-ba9d-522a0a8050d9"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"e07466a9442a6d12c25d735797d474b56b55987d7c737f3eafb20afe95e4f764","event_uuid":"9d72c85d-a5d3-4059-98e8-44f8b2b66fd4","position":{"commit_sha":"541b90570468827a92a52bc0c25bf95b39f8107b","position":"1787862013964010001-9d72c85d-a5d3-4059-98e8-44f8b2b66fd4"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1787861992254001001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"9d72c85d-a5d3-4059-98e8-44f8b2b66fd4","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"5ec7-d681-9616-43ed"}],"description":"## Summary\n\n`autodeploy.sh`'s `MCP_PATHS` delta gate does not include `SECRETS_PATHS`. A change that touches\nONLY `infra/scripts/fetch-secrets.sh` or `infra/terraform/ssm.tf` therefore does not trigger an\nmcp redeploy, so newly-emitted `.env` values never reach the running mcp container. The container\nkeeps serving with a stale environment and nothing reports a problem.\n\n## Why it is not theoretical\n\nThis is the SAME CLASS as the gap already fixed for the review-bot (the `f600` / incident-2731\nwork), which is why `SECRETS_PATHS` exists as a distinct variable in the first place — the bot's\ndelta gate was taught to watch it. The mcp block was never given the same treatment.\n\nIt becomes reachable the moment a secrets-only change lands. Concretely: the Jira wiring under\n`colourless-hasteless-lamb` adds four `JIRA_*` emissions to `fetch-secrets.sh`. That change also\ntouches `docker-compose.yml` (which IS in `MCP_PATHS`), so it happens to redeploy — but a FOLLOW-UP\nthat adjusts only the fetch-secrets side, or an SSM value rotation handled by re-running\nfetch-secrets, would silently not reach the container.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- `infra/scripts/autodeploy.sh:168` — `SECRETS_PATHS='infra/scripts/fetch-secrets.sh infra/terraform/ssm.tf'`\n- The bot block's delta gate consults it; the mcp block's `changed_range \"$mcp_deployed\" \"$TARGET\" \"$MCP_PATHS\"`\n  does not.\n\n## Note on a pure SSM VALUE rotation\n\nA rotation that changes only the SSM value and no git path is out of scope for a git-delta gate\nby construction — no commit exists to detect. That case needs its own mechanism (or an operator\naction) and should NOT be conflated with this bug, which is specifically about a committed\nsecrets change failing to redeploy mcp.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] A commit touching only `SECRETS_PATHS` triggers an mcp redeploy, so refreshed `.env` values\n      reach the container.\n- [ ] A test asserts the mcp delta gate covers `SECRETS_PATHS`, mirroring the review-bot's.\n- [ ] The pure-SSM-value-rotation case is documented as out of scope with its actual remedy named.\n- [ ] LIVE VALIDATION — REQUIRED TO CLOSE. Observed on the box: a secrets-only deploy is followed\n      by an mcp container whose environment carries the new value. Record the autodeploy journal\n      lines and the container identity in a ticket comment.\n\n## Found by\n\nThe subagent wiring `colourless-hasteless-lamb`, as an adjacent gap it correctly declined to fix\nin scope.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["mcp","autodeploy","deploy","infra"],"ticket_id":"f910-ae08-8002-4973","ticket_type":"bug","title":"MCP_PATHS omits SECRETS_PATHS, so a secrets-only change never triggers an mcp redeploy","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["7aa91833-3233-4cec-ba9d-522a0a8050d9","9d72c85d-a5d3-4059-98e8-44f8b2b66fd4"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787865428193930463,"uuid":"4e828df8-732e-4ebb-98c9-d3577f2d3c7d"}